# Engagement Ops — client build config
#
# Base URL for the Ops API. Leave empty for same-origin (the SPA and the API are
# served from the same host behind Cloudflare Access — the recommended setup).
# Set to a full origin only if the API lives elsewhere, e.g. https://ops-api.rdm.is
#
# There is NO API key. Auth is Cloudflare Access; the browser carries the Access
# identity via cookies (all fetches use credentials:"include").
VITE_OPS_API_BASE=
